#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:98
msgid "Why use micromatch?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:100
msgid ""
"micromatch is a [replacement](#switching-to-micromatch) for minimatch and"
" multimatch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:102
msgid ""
"Supports all of the same matching features as "
"[minimatch](https://github.com/isaacs/minimatch) and "
"[multimatch](https://github.com/sindresorhus/multimatch)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:103
msgid ""
"More complete support for the Bash 4.3 specification than minimatch and "
"multimatch. Micromatch passes _all of the spec tests_ from bash, "
"including some that bash still fails."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:104
msgid ""
"**Fast & Performant** - Loads in about 5ms and performs [fast "
"matches](#benchmarks)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:105
msgid ""
"**Glob matching** - Using wildcards (`*` and `?`), globstars (`**`) for "
"nested directories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:106
msgid ""
"**[Advanced globbing](#extended-globbing)** - Supports "
"[extglobs](#extglobs), [braces](#braces-1), and [POSIX brackets](#posix-"
"bracket-expressions), and support for escaping special characters with "
"`\\` or quotes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:107
msgid ""
"**Accurate** - Covers more scenarios [than "
"minimatch](https://github.com/yarnpkg/yarn/pull/3339)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:108
msgid "**Well tested** - More than 5,000 [test assertions](./test)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:109
msgid ""
"**Windows support** - More reliable windows support than minimatch and "
"multimatch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:110
msgid ""
"**[Safe](https://github.com/micromatch/braces#braces-is-safe)** - "
"Micromatch is not subject to DoS with brace patterns like minimatch and "
"multimatch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:112
msgid "Matching features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/micromatch_README.md:114
msgid "Support for multiple glob patterns (no need for wrappers like multimatch)"
msgstr ""

